    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῑλο-κέρᾰμος</span></b> , ὁ, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψί̄λο-ον</span></b> , τό, perh. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glazed
				tiles,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμῶσαι τῆς στοᾶς μεταστύλια ἓξ
					ψιλοκεράμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					366
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				462
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῑλο-κέρᾰμον</span></b> 
			=
			<i>suggrunda</i> (i. e. <i>eaves),</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
